  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Darfur Climate Smart Actions for Food Security and Income (FSL)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">o counter the effects of climate change and enhance food security while at the same time increase livelihood options for rural women and youth initially in two geographical areas in Sudan &#x2013; Central Darfur and the Greater Kordofan states. Focus on use of improved seeds, minimize household dependency on natural resources through using alternative energy and engaging in climate-smart jobs through value chains in seedling production, solar markets, and energy-saving stoves.???</narrative>
  </description>
